cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, or cite the values it establishes, please cite the archived version below."
title: "BishopVerify: independent verification of the b-files for the bishop-arrangement sequences"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free verification program for the b-files behind ten new values of
  the bishop-arrangement sequences OEIS A289145, A289169, A290719, A290769 and
  A291595. It checks b-file format conformance, the structural identities the
  problem forces, strict monotonicity, and agreement with the live OEIS record,
  and includes an independent recomputation and a tamper test that must make the
  gate fail.
type: software
authors:
